        "description": "Feeding difficulties and failure to thrive in infancy",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of congenital hypotonia, intellectual disability, abnormal glycosylation pattern, and pathogenic SSR4 gene variants",
